@startuml
title 05f - User Management Profile Image Update
autonumber

actor "Frontend / Postman" as FE
participant "Gateway :8099" as GW
participant "Setting Service :8092" as SET
participant "Setting Filters\n(CompanyContext + AuditLog)" as SF
database "Setting DB" as SDB

FE -> GW: POST /api/v1/setting/users/profile-image/update\n{username, file(base64), fileName, fileType, type}
GW -> SET: Forward

SET -> SF: Audit USER_PROFILE_IMAGE_UPDATE
SET -> SDB: Find user by username
SET -> SDB: Save profileImgDoc + fileName + fileType + type

SET --> GW: updated profileImg
GW --> FE: Response

note over FE
Stored as received base64 payload (no conversion in service).
end note

@enduml

